[+Mouse-]
    <Boot>U
    <Pause>I
    <Transcribe>O
    <TranscribePause>P
[-Mouse+]

[+MouseTranscribe-]
    <LeftClick>左键点击
    <LeftDown>左键按下
    <LeftUp>左键弹起
    <RightClick>右键点击
    <RightDown>右键按下
    <RightUp>右键弹起
    <MiddleClick>滚轮键点击
    <MiddleDown>滚轮键按下
    <MiddleUp>滚轮键弹起
[-MouseTranscribe+]
